cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these materials, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Good Practice for R Users When Working in the ONS SRS: workshop materials"
abstract: >-
  Materials for a one-hour workshop on efficient, reproducible and robust R
  workflows for large linked administrative data in the ONS Secure Research
  Service and comparable trusted research environments. Uses public NYC TLC
  High Volume For-Hire Vehicle trip records (2024) as a worked example, with
  data.table, dplyr, Arrow and DBI/dbplyr implementations and self-study
  lesson notes.
authors:
